# Web

- Run simulation only in a Web Worker on `fx-wasm`. Never block the main thread.
- Keep WASM single-threaded. Parallelize with one simulation per worker.
- Render with instanced meshes. Greedy-mesh chunks. Collapse distant parts to LOD blocks.
- TypeScript is strict. Ask before adding a UI framework.
